cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "real-time-temperature-correction"
abstract: >-
  Code of the paper "Real-time temperature correction for urban sensor networks". It contains RegSARIMA, a
  regression on the other stations of a temperature network with a SARIMA model of its residuals, which reconstructs
  the readings of a failed station in real time, together with the eleven models it is compared with, the experiments
  of the paper and the scripts that generate its figures and tables.
authors:
